# Frozen landscape bytes: git must never rewrite line endings on checkout.
#
# Found 2026-08-20, by cloning this repository into a clean directory and
# running the suite there. The paths in this file still said
# `src/corpus/data/**` after the landscapes moved to `corpora/`, so
# `buchungen_report.csv` — a Latin-1 CSV, deliberately — came out of a fresh
# clone with different bytes from the ones every recorded number was scored
# against. Nothing in the maintainer's working tree could show that; only a
# fresh checkout can.
#
# Wildcard on purpose: a new landscape is covered the day it is added, with no
# line to remember to extend.
corpora/** -text
